+ * instead of ERROR/ERROR_MASK/ERROR_STREAMS. Offsets, bit meanings and the
+ * acknowledgement sequence are behaviours of this Mac's own macOS DART driver and
+ * SPTM: kernel/experiments/usb-gadget/dart-diag/rea-dart-2026-10-18.md (G1-G6, E6,
+ * T1, T4, T6). Nothing below is used on a DART that reports a version below 2.2.
+ */
